    heading "Short Title of 2012 Amendment"
    p ["Pub. L. 112–231, § 1" -> "/us/pl/112/231/s1"] ", Dec. 28, 2012, " ["126 Stat. 1619" -> "/us/stat/126/1619"] ", provided that:"
    quoted "/us/pl/112/231/s1" {
      p "“This Act [amending this section and sections 92a, 215, and 215a of Title 12, Banks and Banking] may be cited as the ‘21st Century Language Act of 2012’.”"
